{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the Beast.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Beast Is Yet To Come, a ferocious 3D action roguelike, take control of a towering Troll built for destruction. Survive against relentless hordes, navigate shifting battlefields shaped by dynamic weather, and master the primal art of combat through visceral \u201cpunch hell\u201d combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Devastation</strong> \u2013 Combine and evolve unique skills to create devastating chain attacks. No two runs \u2014 or punches \u2014 are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Combat</strong> \u2013 Face waves of foes in real-time, physics-heavy brawls where momentum, positioning, and brutality rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong> \u2013 Each map changes with unpredictable weather effects \u2014 fog, lightning storms, mudslides \u2014 affecting both you and your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo Crafting</strong> \u2013 Build your own \u201cpunch hell\u201d system using a flexible skill tree filled with brutal perks, elemental modifiers, and beast-fueled abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the hero. You are the storm.<br><strong>The Beast Is Yet To Come.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771100?t=1761612101","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/7547b63eb48f1029cbf2e81e2ff58f0e44d2eac4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761612101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/99e09f0bb6c54a681ea5128e71cd4863df382496/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761612101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771100/99e09f0bb6c54a681ea5128e71cd4863df382496/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761612101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains physical violence and blood."},"demos":[{"appid":3892650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the Beast.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Beast Is Yet To Come, a ferocious 3D action roguelike, take control of a towering Troll built for destruction. Survive against relentless hordes, navigate shifting battlefields shaped by dynamic weather, and master the primal art of combat through visceral \u201cpunch hell\u201d combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Devastation</strong> \u2013 Combine and evolve unique skills to create devastating chain attacks. No two runs \u2014 or punches \u2014 are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Combat</strong> \u2013 Face waves of foes in real-time, physics-heavy brawls where momentum, positioning, and brutality rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong> \u2013 Each map changes with unpredictable weather effects \u2014 fog, lightning storms, mudslides \u2014 affecting both you and your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo Crafting</strong> \u2013 Build your own \u201cpunch hell\u201d system using a flexible skill tree filled with brutal perks, elemental modifiers, and beast-fueled abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not the hero. You are the storm.<br><strong>The Beast Is Yet To Come.</strong></p>","developers":["Mileo.io"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://share